{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國存儲晶片巨頭SK海力士正在推動新一代iHBM（Integrated High Bandwidth Memory）技術邁向量產階段，並已開始討論相關量產計劃。面對人工智能產業快速發展帶來的算力需求激增，高帶寬存儲器（HBM）的散熱問題正成為影響性能提升的重要瓶頸，而iHBM被視為解決這一難題的重要技術路線。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583230.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.995074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:27:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.265133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"2b5390ede3407ada7bb380904e362701f68763f2cb18495bffc42babc1296392","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}